"markdown": "### Lasso\n\n**A screenshot takes everything. Lasso takes just what you need, and keeps it where you can see it. And it records what you hear: both sides of your calls, and the sound your apps play.**\n\nPress the screenshot buttons and the screen freezes. Drag across the part you want, then pin it, read it, mark it up, share it or record it.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
