},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Snap and Pin:** Quickly select any part of the screen, float pins above any app, lock their position or let touches pass through.\n- **Audio & Call Recording:** Record both sides of phone/FaceTime calls and system audio/microphone with ease.\n- **Read Text & Barcodes:** Extract text and scan QR codes/barcodes in over 50 languages, with built-in translation.\n- **Markup & Long Snaps:** Pen and marker tools, privacy blur/pixelate, a HEX color picker, and automatic page-scrolling snaps stitched into a single image.\n- **Unified Library:** Organize snaps, recordings, and calls by day, protected with Face ID/Touch ID.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
